      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Validate the login credentials.\n\n- When the user clicks Sign In and the credentials match, allow the user to log in.\n\n- When the user clicks Sign In and the credentials do not match, display the error message:\n“Invalid User ID or Password.”\n\n- When the user clicks Sign Up, navigate the user to the Sign-Up page.\n\n- When the user clicks Forgot Password, navigate the user to the Reset Password page.",
      "fontSize": 26.638623929364385,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Validate the login credentials.\n\n- When the user clicks Sign In and the credentials match, allow the user to log in.\n\n- When the user clicks Sign In and the credentials do not match, display the error message:\n“Invalid User ID or Password.”\n\n- When the user clicks Sign Up, navigate the user to the Sign-Up page.\n\n- When the user clicks Forgot Password, navigate the user to the Reset Password page.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
