      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784277956801,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- There are a few business flows and views that are not \nexplicitly mentioned in the Excalidraw. However, these \nmay still be expected to be implemented as part of the\nproject.\nFor example, delivery-related processes such as pickup \nand returns should also be taken into consideration \nwhile designing and implementing the system.",
      "fontSize": 30.39609800420408,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- There are a few business flows and views that are not \nexplicitly mentioned in the Excalidraw. However, these \nmay still be expected to be implemented as part of the\nproject.\nFor example, delivery-related processes such as pickup \nand returns should also be taken into consideration \nwhile designing and implementing the system.",
