      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784277956840,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "if the rented product late by the specific time that time apart from the regular rental charges\nlate fees to be applicable and the calculation would be the amount mentioned into above late \nfees feed multiply by number of hours the product get late.\ne.g if the product is rented for 4 hours and return by 4.5 hours the late fees would be \ncharged as 1(hours)*150(late fees charges) = 150 \n\nAlso here one defualt product needs to be created as Late Fees so when the product is return after specified\nrental period and when the return button is clicked on the backend side this product needs to be automatically\nadded to th Sales Order Line with the calculated amount. (in our case it would be 150",
      "fontSize": 15.723813864588893,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "if the rented product late by the specific time that time apart from the regular rental charges\nlate fees to be applicable and the calculation would be the amount mentioned into above late \nfees feed multiply by number of hours the product get late.\ne.g if the product is rented for 4 hours and return by 4.5 hours the late fees would be \ncharged as 1(hours)*150(late fees charges) = 150 \n\nAlso here one defualt product needs to be created as Late Fees so when the product is return after specified\nrental period and when the return button is clicked on the backend side this product needs to be automatically\nadded to th Sales Order Line with the calculated amount. (in our case it would be 150",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
